    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Unfinished Game\u2122 Testing facility! As our new tester, you will have to make your way through a series of unexpected experiments in this first-person adventure. Small puzzles, platforming, meta gameplay and a group of silly NPC awaits you in this unpredictable factory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal? Succesfully finish all tests so that we'll finally be able to release this &quot;Unfinished Game&quot; of ours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One thing for sure, expect only the unexpected in here! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919990/extras/71699647050a23bb4cb546e18fe8049a.avif?t=1751472365\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What you will find:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Simple puzzles  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Platforming  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Other testing bots eager to talk with you   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Some bugs (voluntary..?) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collectables </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Easter eggs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unintentional features (oups!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jokes about the gaming industry </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > And of course, silliness</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919990/extras/8a99e3481757ec3c0e49c9c4ac707534.poster.avif?t=1751472365\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919990/extras/8a99e3481757ec3c0e49c9c4ac707534.webm?t=1751472365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919990/extras/8a99e3481757ec3c0e49c9c4ac707534.mp4?t=1751472365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Join our ranks at the testing facility today for a bug-free tomorrow!&quot;</strong> <br> <br><i><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 -</strong> Unfinished Game Management Team</i></p>",
